afety.\n**Remaining uncertainty:** How severely C\u2019s communication difficulties and egocentric behavior would impact real\u2011world crew coordination on long\u2011haul flights.\n**What would change my vote:** Convincing evidence that B\u2019s weak memory for numbers does not compromise safety (e.g., proven checklist mitigation) **or** concrete, documented examples showing that C consistently communicates effectively and mitigates his egocentric tendencies in crew settings.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
