t real\u2011world crew coordination on extended flights, and whether B\u2019s weak numeric memory could be safely mitigated.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that B (or another candidate) possesses strong, documented teamwork/communication abilities that outweigh his numeric\u2011memory issue, or evidence that C\u2019s communication/egocentric issues lead to crew\u2011coordination problems in practice.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
